   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Quickly Achieve Greater Efficiency </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">Increase production efficiency with ZOLLER's demonstration and used machines, which are available at short notice. Discover first-class solutions for presetting tools, tool inspection, shrinking and unshrinking, balancing, tool storage and transport as well as the automated transfer of tool data.</p> <p class=\"large-text\">All devices have been checked by us. Each works with µm-accuracy as on the first day and is ready for many years of use in your production.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/tr/demonstration-and-used-appliances/offer-overview\">To the offers of demonstration and used appliances</a></p>",
